From 277171c959846de8870732e96d23276575e88ae5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <root@your.mom>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 14:33:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] model: support quality-preserving DeepSeek V4.1 TP3 padding

Load a 64-head/8-group checkpoint into a 72-head/9-group TP3 geometry by duplicating the final input group and zeroing its output projection. The virtual group therefore contributes exactly zero while each rank receives an equal shard.

Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>
